=================================

This notice accompanies the declared source of the `postgres` connector and the
generated projections derived from it. It records the accepted upstream
identity, the retained licence text and the verification steps a consumer must
repeat before using the captured bytes. It is not proof of provider execution,
connector certification, live account authority or customer-schema binding.

